---@field partSizeBytes aws.support.PartSizeBytes The size, in bytes, of each part. Split the file into parts of this size before you upload them to the presigned URLs. For an upload with n total parts, parts 1 through n - 1 are exactly this size; the last part may be smaller. Maximum: 104,857,600 bytes (approximately 100 MB).
